# Backend reference only: the app does NOT automatically load this file or .env.
# Set these in the PowerShell session before starting Python (see README.md).
# Local server startup needs no OAuth secrets; student login needs a private password.
# Defaults below are resolved from the repository, independent of machine paths.
# PLACEPRO_PROFILES_DIR=data/profiles
# PLACEPRO_ASSESSMENTS_DIR=data/assessments
# PLACEPRO_COMPANIES_DB=data/companies.db
# PLACEPRO_SALARY_DEFAULT_COLLEGE_TIER=Tier 2
# Local development session policy (required for HTTP loopback development):
# PLACEPRO_SECURITY_MODE=development
# PLACEPRO_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:5173
# Local development student. Provisioned only by the backend (startup or
# scripts/seed_dev_student.py) and only in explicit development mode.
# Prefer hidden input: python scripts/seed_dev_student.py --password
# Set PLACEPRO_SECURITY_MODE=development first; never use dev credentials in production.
# PLACEPRO_DEV_STUDENT_EMAIL=student@placepro.com
# PLACEPRO_DEV_STUDENT_PASSWORD=
# No default password. Supply privately for startup provisioning, or leave unset
# and use the hidden-prompt seed script. Do not commit passwords or other secrets.
# Google OAuth 2.0. Leave both unset to keep Google sign-in disabled with a
# clear UI message; never commit real client credentials.
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<your-client-id>.apps.googleusercontent.com
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=<your-client-secret>
# GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/auth/google/callback
# PLACEPRO_APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5173
# Uvicorn / scripts/placepro.ps1 defaults:
# UVICORN_HOST=127.0.0.1
# UVICORN_PORT=8765
# Test-only URL: selects a new owned loopback server, never an existing API.
# PLACEPRO_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8766
# PLACEPRO_TEST_STORAGE_ROOT and PLACEPRO_TEST_RUN_ID are fixture-owned, not dev settings.
